  "lessons": [
    {
      "contentKey": "ENG-A1-007-POSSESSIVE-ADJECTIVES",
      "slug": "eng-a1-007-possessive-adjectives",
      "sortOrder": 10,
      "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-POSSESSIVE-ADJECTIVES"],
      "prerequisiteContentKeys": ["ENG-A1-006-NUMBERS-PERSONAL-INFO"],
      "revision": {
        "title": "Egalik sifatlari",
        "description": "my, your, his, her, its, our, their.",
        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Bugun nimani o'rganamiz?\n\nBu darsda **egalik sifatlari**ni o'rganasiz — biror narsa kimga tegishli ekanini ko'rsatuvchi so'zlar: *my, your, his, her ...*" }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 3,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Qoida\n\nEgalik sifati **otdan oldin** keladi: **my** book, **her** name.\n\n| Egalik sifati | Ma'nosi |\n| --- | --- |\n| **my** | mening |\n| **your** | sening / sizning |\n| **his** | uning (erkak) |\n| **her** | uning (ayol) |\n| **its** | uning (narsa/hayvon) |\n| **our** | bizning |\n| **their** | ularning |" }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "- This is **my** phone.\n- What is **your** name?\n- Aziz is happy. **His** job is interesting.\n- Laylo is a teacher. **Her** students are young.\n- This is **our** car. **Our** car is blue.\n- This is **their** house." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-POSSESSIVE-ADJECTIVES"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "This is ___ book. (mening)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "my" }, { "id": "b", "text": "I" }, { "id": "c", "text": "me" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Ko'p uchraydigan xato\n\n> Olmosh (*he, she*) va egalik sifatini (*his, her*) aralashtirmang.\n>\n> Noto'g'ri: *He name is Aziz.* → To'g'ri: **His name is Aziz.**\n> Noto'g'ri: *She brother is a doctor.* → To'g'ri: **Her brother is a doctor.**\n\n**his** — erkak uchun, **her** — ayol uchun." }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-POSSESSIVE-ADJECTIVES"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "Aziz is a student. ___ teacher is Mr. Karimov. (uning)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "His" }, { "id": "b", "text": "Her" }, { "id": "c", "text": "He" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-POSSESSIVE-ADJECTIVES"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "This is Laylo. ___ cat is black. (uning)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "His" }, { "id": "b", "text": "Her" }, { "id": "c", "text": "She" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "MASTERY_TEST",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-POSSESSIVE-ADJECTIVES"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "We are a family. ___ house is big. (bizning)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "Our" }, { "id": "b", "text": "Their" }, { "id": "c", "text": "We" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Xulosa\n\n- Egalik sifatlari: **my, your, his, her, its, our, their** — otdan oldin.\n- Erkak — **his**, ayol — **her**." }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "contentKey": "ENG-A1-008-FAMILY",
      "slug": "eng-a1-008-family",
      "sortOrder": 20,
      "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-FAMILY-VOCAB", "ENG-A1-POSSESSIVE-ADJECTIVES"],
      "prerequisiteContentKeys": ["ENG-A1-007-POSSESSIVE-ADJECTIVES"],
      "revision": {
        "title": "Oila a'zolari",
        "description": "mother, father, sister, brother va boshqa oila so'zlari.",
        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Bugun nimani o'rganamiz?\n\nBu darsda **oila a'zolari**ning inglizcha nomlarini o'rganasiz va o'z oilangiz haqida oddiy gap tuza olasiz." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 3,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## So'zlar\n\n| Inglizcha | Ma'nosi |\n| --- | --- |\n| **mother** | ona |\n| **father** | ota |\n| **parents** | ota-ona |\n| **brother** | aka / uka |\n| **sister** | opa / singil |\n| **husband** | er (turmush o'rtog'i) |\n| **wife** | rafiqa |\n| **son** | o'g'il |\n| **daughter** | qiz (farzand) |\n| **children** | bolalar |\n\n> **E'tibor bering:** *child* (bola) so'zining ko'plik shakli qoidasiz — **children**." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "- My **mother** is a doctor.\n- This is my **brother**. His name is Sardor.\n- My **sister** is a student.\n- Their **parents** are teachers.\n- These are my **children**." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-FAMILY-VOCAB"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "My father and my mother are my ___.", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "parents" }, { "id": "b", "text": "children" }, { "id": "c", "text": "sisters" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Ko'p uchraydigan xato\n\n> *child* ning ko'pligi **children**, *childs* emas.\n>\n> Noto'g'ri: *two childs* → To'g'ri: **two children**\n\nEgani ikki marta takrorlamang:\n\n> Noto'g'ri: *My mother she is a doctor.* → To'g'ri: **My mother is a doctor.**" }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-FAMILY-VOCAB"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "\"child\" so'zining ko'plik shakli qaysi?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "childs" }, { "id": "b", "text": "children" }, { "id": "c", "text": "childrens" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-FAMILY-VOCAB", "ENG-A1-POSSESSIVE-ADJECTIVES"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "Qaysi gap to'g'ri?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "My mother is a teacher." }, { "id": "b", "text": "My mother she is a teacher." }, { "id": "c", "text": "My mother are a teacher." } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "MASTERY_TEST",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-FAMILY-VOCAB"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "\"parents\" so'zi kimlarni bildiradi?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "mother and father" }, { "id": "b", "text": "sister and brother" }, { "id": "c", "text": "son and daughter" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Xulosa\n\n- Oila: mother, father, parents, brother, sister, son, daughter, children.\n- **children** — *child* ning qoidasiz ko'pligi." }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
