      "revision": {
        "title": "Have va has",
        "description": "have / has bilan egalikni ifodalash.",
        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Bugun nimani o'rganamiz?\n\nBu darsda **have** va **has** yordamida biror narsaga ega ekaningizni aytishni o'rganasiz." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 3,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Qoida\n\n| Olmosh | Fe'l |\n| --- | --- |\n| **I / you / we / they** | have |\n| **he / she / it** | has |\n\nYa'ni **he, she, it** bilan **has**, qolganlari bilan **have**.\n\nMisol: I **have** a brother. She **has** a car." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "- I **have** a brother.\n- She **has** two sisters.\n- We **have** a big family.\n- He **has** a new phone.\n- They **have** three children." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-HAVE-HAS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "She ___ two sisters.", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "have" }, { "id": "b", "text": "has" }, { "id": "c", "text": "haves" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Ko'p uchraydigan xato\n\n> *he, she, it* bilan **has** ishlatiladi, **have** emas. \"haves\" degan shakl yo'q.\n>\n> Noto'g'ri: *He have a car.* → To'g'ri: **He has a car.**\n> Noto'g'ri: *She haves a car.* → To'g'ri: **She has a car.**" }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-HAVE-HAS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "I ___ a big family.", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "has" }, { "id": "b", "text": "have" }, { "id": "c", "text": "haves" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-HAVE-HAS", "ENG-A1-FAMILY-VOCAB"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "My brother ___ a new phone.", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "have" }, { "id": "b", "text": "has" }, { "id": "c", "text": "is have" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "MASTERY_TEST",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-HAVE-HAS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "They ___ three children.", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "has" }, { "id": "b", "text": "have" }, { "id": "c", "text": "haves" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Xulosa\n\n- **I / you / we / they → have**\n- **he / she / it → has**\n- \"haves\" degan shakl yo'q." }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
